{"steam_appid":3417120,"steam_name":"Lakeside Bar","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3417120/612543729/6529ee8bac46aa9bf95fe3bd83b3015a414fc10e/1768200676/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768212021","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257263384/6e2ff091e60a36b9636d661176826a4ef939bcb6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768212021","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/1dd66abf8a15233b8057ce6d97dc8be64ec54963/ss_1dd66abf8a15233b8057ce6d97dc8be64ec54963.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786072209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/1243ef607712f19d8ff94d0aa42dd51d3b70bb93/ss_1243ef607712f19d8ff94d0aa42dd51d3b70bb93.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786072209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/cf6c64b63e60c402ed15c1a0c53cdc9d47beeea4/ss_cf6c64b63e60c402ed15c1a0c53cdc9d47beeea4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786072209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/9887a2a77b1240631dba7c31745a6e037ff9ab2b/ss_9887a2a77b1240631dba7c31745a6e037ff9ab2b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786072209","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/29ab697f1e0c1ad8829a26163fed5ca77a473df7/ss_29ab697f1e0c1ad8829a26163fed5ca77a473df7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786072209"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place to <strong>unwind, mix drinks, and serve warm meals</strong> to charming guests—whether in f<strong>ullscreen or tucked neatly at the bottom of your screen</strong> as you go about your day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/35eabf4b3dc1567411f4bd3e0a87fd90.poster.avif?t=1786072209\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/35eabf4b3dc1567411f4bd3e0a87fd90.webm?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/35eabf4b3dc1567411f4bd3e0a87fd90.mp4?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a16b036f350b234be12a12d598f31e21.webp?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your bar stocked, set the perfect table, and welcome your guests with care. After all, the heart of a great bar is the people inside it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.poster.avif?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.webm?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/f70680c37f4c748604af227feb257a9d.mp4?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/9158f69580d49e3528e70d7520b6a82f.webp?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire staff to keep things running while you sit back and relax. No rush, no pressure—just the soothing hum of a bar that flows on its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And... of course, if the mood strikes, you can always jump in.                </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.poster.avif?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.webm?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/b3c7ced14bd3c418f0daca75ef64fd1f.mp4?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/37b19703bb1630191281a58163377dda.webp?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style your bar, set the mood, and make it the coziest spot by the lake. And don’t forget the little yard above—it’s yours to decorate and shape however you like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.poster.avif?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.webm?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a3d29d8b9efdedce44cb7cfb1d8128d3.mp4?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/e3afcd0921cb5f76fabaf6a4ccdfda52.webp?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow and harvest crops for fresh bar ingredients, assisted by magical garden spirits. Store your harvest and unlock special hidden menu items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/7088cbf43117cf0fbc702f58b7899cdf.poster.avif?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/7088cbf43117cf0fbc702f58b7899cdf.webm?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/7088cbf43117cf0fbc702f58b7899cdf.mp4?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/432ff48fdfad30ecdeccb6c73f8db880.webp?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special customers are visiting to rate your bar. Serve them well - this bar is yours to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a6cc7c35aa861b8593fa29b989192b4b.poster.avif?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a6cc7c35aa861b8593fa29b989192b4b.webm?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/a6cc7c35aa861b8593fa29b989192b4b.mp4?t=1786072209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417120/extras/e2f755d0ea9cc90259a0f04c834e0cf0.webp?t=1786072209\" width=608 height=59 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new drinks, snacks, and music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out fresh recipes to impress your guests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your resources for a smoother flow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy various mini games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And much more, all at your pace!</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel® Core™ i3 @ 3.2 GHZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 256 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["BITCOVER"],"publishers":["BITCOVER","CC_Games"],"release_date":"30 Jul, 2025"}